    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Fulgrim",
    "summary": "During [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) and [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), once this model finishes its attacks, pick an enemy unit that at least one of those attacks hit. That unit is poisoned for the rest of the battle.\n\nAs [either player's Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, roll a D6 for every poisoned enemy unit still on the battlefield. Each one that rolls a 4+ takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.",
